%chk=probe_nh_rohf_iop_both.chk
%mem=2GB
%nprocshared=1
#P ROHF/6-31G NoSymm Int=NoBasisTransform SCF=(Conver=10)
# Output=(MatrixElement,MO2ElectronIntegrals) Tran=(Full,Force) Window=(2,11) IOp(8/5=1,8/40=2)

probe_nh_rohf_iop_both: probe_nh_rohf (both switches, degenerate pi SOMOs).
Tests whether IOp(8/5) (1 = do not pseudo-canonicalize ROHF orbitals) and
IOp(8/40) (2 = treat the ROHF window as RHF, transforming only the alpha
orbitals) make Gaussian transform over the ROHF orbitals themselves. Without
them (the M0 probes) TRANS MO COEFFICIENTS were per-spin semicanonical and
g16dump extract refused the file. SUCCESS: TRANS MO COEFFICIENTS equal the
active ROHF MOs, so extract --reference ROHF accepts it, and validate shows h'
alpha/beta agreement and E_ref = E(SCF).

0 3
N   0.0000000   0.0000000   0.0000000
H   0.0000000   0.0000000   1.0450000

probe_nh_rohf_iop_both.mat

